("> Azlyn said green, the cup went pink, and you wrote both down in the same pen.\n> Nothing bad happened to her. Cabbage water is the cheapest place she will ever\n> be wrong, and the cost of being wrong is the thing she is learning this\n> morning, well ahead of the chemistry. Children whose predictions get recorded\n> and checked by an adult who stays neutral about the outcome carry on guessing\n> out loud. Children who get corrected go quiet and wait to be told. Read the\n> wrong guesses back in the same voice you use for the right ones, and she will\n> still be guessing out loud at eleven, when it counts for more.",
 "> Azlyn said green, the cup went pink, and you wrote both down in the same pen.\n> Nothing bad happened to her. Cabbage water is the cheapest place she will ever\n> be wrong, and the cost of being wrong is what she is learning this morning,\n> well ahead of the chemistry. Children whose predictions get recorded and\n> checked by an adult who stays neutral about the outcome carry on guessing out\n> loud. Children who get corrected go quiet and wait to be told. Read the wrong\n> guesses back in the voice you use for the right ones, and she will still be\n> guessing out loud at eleven, when it counts for more."),

